...is to have a stronger
heart than anyone else.

00:13:48.207 --> 00:13:52.647
Then if someone from the invading
armies were to become Pillar...

00:13:52.947 --> 00:13:54.207
I get it...

00:13:54.687 --> 00:13:57.207
Cephiro's already starting to crumble.

00:13:57.317 --> 00:14:01.117
I was wondering why they
were starting their invasions now...

00:14:01.227 --> 00:14:05.087
If they become the Pillar,
they can run Cephiro as they wish!

00:14:05.197 --> 00:14:08.627
Then how can we protect Cephiro?

00:14:09.397 --> 00:14:13.057
The only way is to find a Pillar
that prays for Cephiro's peace.

00:14:14.137 --> 00:14:15.397
Precisely.

00:14:16.467 --> 00:14:19.407
While protecting Cephiro
from the invaders...

00:14:19.937 --> 00:14:25.607
...we must find a new Pillar to lead
Cephiro to peace as soon as possible.

00:14:28.487 --> 00:14:31.607
Presea, I want you
to lend us weapons.

00:14:32.017 --> 00:14:34.647
I will fight to save Cephiro!

00:14:37.897 --> 00:14:40.157
Presea, lend us weapons!

00:14:40.597 --> 00:14:42.327
We will fight as well!

00:15:23.767 --> 00:15:26.067
These swords are the ones we...

00:15:26.407 --> 00:15:29.637
Yes, the weapons that you evolved.

00:15:30.677 --> 00:15:34.877
They are the weapons of the Magic
Knights that only you can use.

00:15:36.347 --> 00:15:41.307
Just like before, if you wish
for them when you need them...

00:15:41.887 --> 00:15:44.617
...they will reappear in your hands.

00:15:45.557 --> 00:15:47.427
If we wish for them...

00:15:48.967 --> 00:15:50.367
W-What is this?

00:15:50.937 --> 00:15:52.487
The gems suddenly...

00:15:52.597 --> 00:15:54.587
W-What exactly is this?

00:15:57.337 --> 00:15:58.397
Hikaru!

00:15:58.607 --> 00:16:00.437
Umi! Fuu!

00:16:11.287 --> 00:16:13.117
Magic Knights...

00:16:17.287 --> 00:16:22.527
The three Magic Knights
from another world.

00:16:25.397 --> 00:16:26.957
They're calling us.

00:16:27.767 --> 00:16:29.067
This voice...

00:16:30.037 --> 00:16:32.267
It's the voices of the Rune-Gods!

00:16:35.277 --> 00:16:39.767
Legendary Magic Knights!

00:16:40.377 --> 00:16:41.437
Rayearth!

00:16:42.187 --> 00:16:43.117
Selece!

00:16:44.387 --> 00:16:45.317
Windam!

00:16:46.417 --> 00:16:49.617
Magic Knights from another world.

00:16:50.287 --> 00:16:55.027
Thou hast been summoned
to solve the crisis of Cephiro.

00:16:56.627 --> 00:17:00.927
Will thou don us once again
and head out to battle?

00:17:02.367 --> 00:17:03.807
I will fight.

00:17:04.577 --> 00:17:07.037
I know what I'm getting into this time.

00:17:07.947 --> 00:17:10.347
It is my own decision to fight as well.

00:17:10.447 --> 00:17:12.967
We want to fight for Cephiro!

00:17:14.817 --> 00:17:19.587
We have passed
the long years to save Cephiro.

00:17:20.487 --> 00:17:25.427
Magic Knights, thine hearts
hath verily been proven to us.

00:17:29.767 --> 00:17:33.637
Don us and fight for Cephiro.

00:17:43.747 --> 00:17:45.267
T-This is?

00:17:46.017 --> 00:17:48.007
We are above the castle.

00:17:54.557 --> 00:17:56.787
How in the world did we get here?

00:17:56.887 --> 00:18:00.727
Thou hast been in the
dimension where we sleep.

00:18:03.167 --> 00:18:04.357
Dimension...

00:18:04.967 --> 00:18:08.027
We wait always
in the other dimension.

00:18:08.967 --> 00:18:12.837
When thou need us, call our names.

00:18:13.737 --> 00:18:17.807
We shall always show
ourselves before thee.

00:18:18.577 --> 00:18:19.507
Always.

00:18:21.917 --> 00:18:22.847
Okay.

00:18:23.487 --> 00:18:24.417
Thanks.

00:18:33.197 --> 00:18:34.717
How far are we flying?

00:18:34.827 --> 00:18:36.417
Above the sky.

00:18:37.897 --> 00:18:39.887
Is there something above the sky?

00:18:40.437 --> 00:18:44.897
There is a battleship from another
country far above Cephiro's skies.

00:18:46.237 --> 00:18:47.437
Battleship?

00:19:00.057 --> 00:19:01.887
This is amazing, Eagle.

00:19:02.757 --> 00:19:04.517
What is it, Geo?

00:19:06.427 --> 00:19:10.797
Some unidentified objects have
suddenly shown up in front of us.

00:19:10.897 --> 00:19:13.457
Hey, what do you mean unidentified?

00:19:13.567 --> 00:19:16.037
Hold on. I'll put it on the screen.

00:19:19.807 --> 00:19:20.737
Wow!

00:19:21.047 --> 00:19:22.507
Look, giant robots!

00:19:22.607 --> 00:19:23.807
Wow! Wow! Wow!

00:19:23.907 --> 00:19:25.307
Awesome!

00:19:25.417 --> 00:19:27.407
I wonder if they transform?

00:19:28.547 --> 00:19:31.747
So is your curiosity as
a mechanic showing up, Zazu?

00:19:31.857 --> 00:19:34.877
Aren't you curious
yourself as a fighter, Geo?

00:19:35.387 --> 00:19:38.787
Those are the legendary
Rune-Gods of Cephiro.

00:19:41.197 --> 00:19:42.927
Those are the Rune-Gods?

00:19:43.027 --> 00:19:46.797
So that means the legendary
Magic Knights are inside them?

00:19:49.637 --> 00:19:52.227
Zazu, prepare my FTO for launch.

00:19:53.407 --> 00:19:54.667
That thing?

00:19:55.007 --> 00:19:56.777
Why in the world...

00:19:58.647 --> 00:20:01.847
I'll go say hello
to the legendary Magic Knights.

00:20:02.517 --> 00:20:06.457
What's the supreme commander of
this ship doing, going in head first?

00:20:07.517 --> 00:20:12.387
Because I'm responsible for this ship,
I need to go give the proper regards...

00:20:12.497 --> 00:20:17.017
...to the legendary Magic Knights
who saved Cephiro from its crisis.

00:20:20.337 --> 00:20:22.767
So that's... the battleship.

00:20:45.057 --> 00:20:46.287
FTO...

00:20:47.457 --> 00:20:48.397
Go.

00:20:51.197 --> 00:20:52.357
It's coming!

00:21:00.977 --> 00:21:02.137
I-It's fast!

00:21:13.287 --> 00:21:14.277
Hikaru!

00:21:14.487 --> 00:21:15.577
Ms. Hikaru!

00:21:22.097 --> 00:21:25.997
I am the supreme commander
on this mission to invade Cephiro.

00:21:26.097 --> 00:21:28.897
Eagle Vision of Autozam.

00:21:31.177 --> 00:21:32.367
I am...

00:21:32.477 --> 00:21:34.407
I am Hikaru Shidou!

00:21:36.907 --> 00:21:40.907
So you're the legendary Magic
Knights I've heard so much about.

00:21:45.057 --> 00:21:47.677
I will protect Cephiro!

00:22:02.937 --> 00:22:08.337
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:09.007 --> 00:22:16.277
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:17.717 --> 00:22:23.277
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:23.987 --> 00:22:27.787
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:28.167 --> 00:22:30.527
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:32.367 --> 00:22:35.667
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:36.037 --> 00:22:39.367
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:39.807 --> 00:22:46.717
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:22:47.147 --> 00:22:50.547
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:22:50.887 --> 00:22:59.317
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:02.167 --> 00:23:05.497
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.737 --> 00:23:13.797
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:15.877 --> 00:23:22.677
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:31.057 --> 00:23:33.027
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:33.457 --> 00:23:36.757
Eagle from Autozam,
an invader to Cephiro.

00:23:37.067 --> 00:23:41.087
He assaulted our
Rune-Gods on his white FTO.

00:23:41.737 --> 00:23:44.607
We fended him off
but had no time to rest.

00:23:44.707 --> 00:23:49.167
Something surprising was waiting
for us back at the castle in Cephiro.

00:23:49.547 --> 00:23:51.607
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:23:51.717 --> 00:23:54.117
Autozam's Invasion and Lantis.

00:23:54.217 --> 00:23:54.417
You have to watch it!

00:23:54.417 --> 00:23:56.217
Autozam's Invasion and Lantis
You have to watch it!

00:23:56.217 --> 00:23:58.417
Autozam's Invasion and Lantis

00:23:58.417 --> 00:24:06.347
Who is it today?

00:24:06.627 --> 00:24:08.327
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:08.427 --> 00:24:09.127
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:09.127 --> 00:24:11.437
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:11.437 --> 00:24:13.097
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:13.097 --> 00:24:14.397
Look forward to the next episode!
